WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Call the KC1 prediction API from its own documentation page, in three steps.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
1. On the API's page, select POST /predict.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
2. Select Try it out, and paste the module's 21 metrics.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
3. Select Execute: 200, and the prediction Non-defective.
